UPDATE companies SET description='Twin Rivers Foods was founded in 2006 and is headquartered in Fort Smith, Arkansas. The company operates chicken processing plants in Atkins, Fort Smith, and Mulberry, Arkansas, with corporate offices in Fayetteville. Leadership includes CEO Nick Tyler, Owner Doug Tyler, COO Michele Tyler, and a team with decades of poultry industry experience.

The company specializes in value-added chicken processing, offering ready-to-cook products, individual quick freezing, marination, deboning, specialty portioning, stripping and skewering, and various packaging options.

The leadership team brings over 30 years in poultry sales, production, procurement, and meat science, which the company says enables it to see opportunities in customers'' businesses.

