UPDATE companies SET description='US Sports & Apparel was established in 2014 in Marlborough, Massachusetts. The company is led by CEO Annie Nutter, President Ben Nutter, and VP of Production TJ LaPlante, who oversee strategy, sales, operations, and production innovation.

