UPDATE companies SET description='USA Auto Parts Inc. was established in 2009 in Cicero, Illinois, a suburb of Chicago. The company operates as an online distributor of automotive parts and accessories, serving both retail consumers and wholesale buyers across the United States.

The distributor maintains a catalog of more than 550,000 SKUs sourced from aftermarket manufacturers, covering domestic and foreign vehicle makes and models. Order fulfillment is handled through several strategically located warehouses nationwide, enabling rapid processing and delivery.

Customers include individual vehicle owners seeking replacement parts and wholesale accounts such as repair shops and fleet operators. The platform supports search by year, make, model, engine, and VIN, and offers a dedicated wholesale login for business-to-business transactions.

