UPDATE companies SET description='Ultimate Truck Off Road operates from a 3,000-square-foot showroom in Omaha, Nebraska. The business was founded in November 1990 by Scott Benson in the Millard area and relocated to its current site after 24 years. In January 2019, Benson sold the company to Matt Fryman and Marty Choyeske, who continue to run the retail and installation operation.

