UPDATE companies SET description='Unique Custom Furniture is based in Fredericktown, Ohio, in Knox County. Founded in 1995 as a family-owned business, the company began when its owners started collecting barnwood from old barns in the surrounding area, refining and finishing the wood, and selling pieces at furniture shows.

The company designs and builds custom furniture from reclaimed chestnut and oak barnwood aged 100–200 years, sourced from Ohio, Appalachia, North Carolina, and Tennessee. The process involves kiln drying for two to four weeks, processing by an Amish wood specialist (planing, straight-line cutting, nail and dust removal), then in-house cutting, sanding, finishing, assembly, and quality inspection. Products include benches, buffets, tables, stools, dressers, hutches, office furniture, and media consoles.

The company’s reclaimed barnwood furniture appeals to buyers seeking heirloom-quality pieces with historical character.

The founders were amazed at the beauty of finished old barnwood long before a barnwood furniture industry existed. They emphasize a unique aesthetic, a refined making process, and the use of genuine American barnwood handcrafted by skilled artisans, positioning each piece as a connection to American history.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Reclaimed barnwood sourcing", "Kiln drying (2\u20134 weeks)", "Wood processing (planing, straight-line cutting, nail/dust removal)", "Cutting and machining", "Sanding", "Finishing", "Assembly", "Quality inspection", "Blanket wrap packaging", "White glove delivery", "Custom inlays from salvaged beams", "Stock furniture inventory (top 10\u201315 products)"], "industries": ["Custom furniture", "Reclaimed barnwood furniture", "Residential furniture", "Home furnishings"], "materials": ["Reclaimed chestnut barnwood", "Reclaimed oak barnwood", "Other hardwoods on request"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "4-6 weeks for custom orders; stocked items available for quick turnaround", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted by skilled artisans from genuine 100\u2013200 year old reclaimed American barnwood", "Unique aesthetic look refined over decades", "Kiln drying (2\u20134 weeks) and Amish partner processing for material preparation", "Blanket wrap and white glove delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1995 -> db", "Headquarters in Fredericktown, Ohio -> /about-us", "Family-owned business -> /about-us", "Began collecting barnwood from old barns in Knox County -> /about-us", "Sells at furniture shows initially -> /about-us", "Sources barnwood from Ohio, Appalachia, North Carolina, Tennessee -> /about-us", "Specializes in 100-200 year old reclaimed chestnut and oak barnwood -> /about-us", "Process: kiln drying 2-4 weeks -> /about-us", "Partners with Ohio Amish wood specialist for processing -> /about-us", "In-house cutting, sanding, finishing, assembly, quality inspecti