UPDATE companies SET description='United Plastic Molders, Inc. was founded in 1978 in Jackson, Mississippi, by William C. (Bill) Hoge, who remains the principal and actively oversees daily operations. The company began with six employees and four machines and has since expanded to six buildings encompassing more than 60,000 square feet.

A staff of about 60 includes six expert tool and die makers, three molding technicians, and a maintenance director skilled in machine programming. Services cover injection molding, mold design and building, mold repair and inspection, prototyping, CNC machining, UV flatbed printing, and assembly and packaging.

Customers span a range of sectors, with client references including Black & Decker, Tyson Foods, Hobie Cat, Duck Commander, Peavey, and Porter Cable, among others. The company works with both large corporations and individual inventors, providing start-to-finish production from concept to packaged parts.

UPM emphasizes hands-on oversight by its founder, an in-house tooling team with decades of experience, and the flexibility to retrofit facility space, equipment, and storage to meet specific customer requirements. The business has grown largely through word-of-mouth referrals, highlighting a reputation for quality workmanship at competitive prices and on-time delivery.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection Molding", "Tool & Die Making", "Mold Design", "Mold Repair", "Mold Inspection", "Prototyping", "Rapid Prototyping", "CNC Milling", "UV Flatbed Printing", "Assembly", "Packaging"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["24 injection molding machines (30\u2013750 tons)", "4 CNC mills (Super Mini 36\"x12\", VF8 64\"x36\")", "UV flatbed printer (24\"x16.5\" print area, 6\" max thickness)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1978 in Jackson, MS by Bill Hoge -> /about-us", "Started with 6 employees and 4 machines -> /about-us", "Now six buildings, 60,000+ sq ft, ~60 employees -> /about-us", "24 molding machines 30-750 tons, 24/5 operation -> /services", "4 CNC mills (Super Mini 36x12, VF8 64x36) -> /services", "6 expert tool & die makers, 3 molding technicians -> /about-us", "Services: injection molding, tool & die, mold design/build, mold repair, prototyping, UV flatbed printing, assembly/packaging -> /services", "Client list includes Black & Decker, Tyson Foods, Hobie Cat, etc. -> /", "UV flatbed printer specs: 24x16.5 print area, 6\" max thickness -> /services", "Principal Bill Hoge has ~50 years experience, oversees every project -> /about-us", "Company grows via word-of-mouth, emphasizes quality and on-time delivery -> /about-us", "Ability to retrofit facility for customer needs -> /about-us", "Mold bases used, aluminum cavity/core for new molds -> /services", "Mold repair, maintenance, inspection for customer-owned molds -> /services", "Prototyping from hand-drawn c