UPDATE companies SET description='Uptime Power Systems operates from Warren, Rhode Island, serving New England and the Mid-Atlantic as a manufacturer''s representative for emergency power equipment.

The company represents a portfolio of manufacturers including Schneider Electric, Starline, SAI Advanced Power Solutions, BTECH, Trystar, PQ Protection, Bender, HITEC, PermAlert, REON, and Olsun Electrics. Its service scope spans design consultation, equipment selection, layout, project management, load-bank testing, infrared scanning, and commissioning support for UPS systems, switchgear, power distribution units, busway, cooling, battery monitoring, and prefabricated data-center modules. A seven-person team — including a licensed professional engineer and former Eaton application engineers — delivers technical support from specification through startup.

Uptime''s customers operate in data centers, healthcare and medical imaging, industrial plants, utilities, institutional and public facilities, transit systems, water and wastewater treatment, and life-sciences laboratories. The firm works directly with consulting engineers, contractors, and facilities teams that require reliable backup power in environments where downtime carries significant risk.

Uptime positions itself as a single point of accountability for the entire power chain, emphasizing that it remains engaged after the purchase order through commissioning and ongoing support. The company highlights its regional knowledge of utilities, codes, and contractors as a differentiator against national firms, combined with the technical depth of its manufacturer relationships.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engineering consultation", "Design consultation", "Equipment selection", "Layout and design", "Project management", "Load bank testing", "Infrared scanning", "Commissioning support", "Site testing", "Technical support", "Power distribution system design", "Emergency power system design", "Power quality solutions", "Electrical switchgear specification", "Building management system integration", "Data center infrastructure design", "Construction management", "Critical infrastructure upgrades", "Manufacturer representation", "Product procurement coordination", "Vendor management", "Power system maintenance support", "Battery monitoring system design", "Prefabricated data center module coordination"], "industries": ["Data Centers", "Industrial", "Utility", "Healthcare and Medical Imaging", "Institutional and Public Facilities", "Transit", "Water and Wastewater", "Lab or Life Sciences"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Starline track busway systems", "SAI Advanced Power Solutions SlimVAC switchgear", "Trystar transfer switches and switchboards", "Bender electrical safety systems", "PermAlert liquid leak detection", "REON battery energy storage systems", "Olsun Electrics dry-type transformers", "Schneider Electric UPS and power distribution", "BTECH DC plant solutions", "HITEC dynamic UPS systems", "PQ Protection surge protection devices", "APC power products"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-source accountability for the full power chain: UPS, switchgear, PDUs, busway, cooling, battery monitoring, prefab data centers", "End-to-end engagement from design consultation through commissioning and ongoing support", "Specialization in mission-critical environments including data centers, hospitals, transit, and utilities", "Local engineering expertise across New England and the Mid-Atlantic with knowledge of regional utilities and codes"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Warren, Rhode Island -> db", "Co-founded by Michael Redman and Rich Su -> /about", "Michael Redman: 20+ years emergency/backup power experience, ex-Eaton, ex-APC -> /about", "Rich Su: 30+ years critical power experience, ex-Eaton Power Quality Application Engineer -> /about", "Team includes Aaron Fernandes (VP Engineering, PE Massachusetts), Nikki Murphy (VP Commercial Operations), Tim Burgess, Richard Deluca, Jenny Lee -> /about", "Manufacturer''s representative for emergency power systems -> /about", "Represents Schneider Electric, Starline, SAI Advanced Power Solutions, BTECH, Trystar, PQ Protection, Bender, HITEC, PermAlert, REON, Olsun Electrics -> /", "Services: design consultation, equipment selection, layout, project management, load bank testing, infrared scanning, commissioning support -> /", "Serves New England and Mid-Atlantic regions -> /", "Markets: Data Centers, Industrial, Utility, Healthcare and Medical Imaging, Institutional and Public Facilities, Transit, Water and Wastewater, Lab or Life Sciences -> /", "Differentiators: single partner for full power chain, stay from spec to startup, best-in-class manufacturers, specialists in high-stakes environments, engineering support, local expertise -> /", "Regional teams in Maine, Vermont, New Hampshire with sales reps Richard Deluca and Mark Macdougal -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are a manufacturer''s representative in the electrical emergency back-up industry, representing the most reputable manufacturers in the New England.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": 