UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2015 in Murfreesboro, Tennessee, Urban Timber Supply began by crafting custom furniture from locally salvaged hardwood, often sourced from trees that have been part of a family''s history for generations. The company transforms these logs into pieces intended to last for generations to come.

The workshop produces a range of custom wood furniture, from small handcrafted items such as executive pens to 15-foot conference tables. Using live-edge slabs of walnut, maple, ash, poplar, cherry, and oak, the team mills, finishes, and occasionally incorporates epoxy resin to accentuate the natural character of each piece. An inventory of hand-selected slabs — black walnut up to 15 feet long and maple up to 15 feet long — is kept on hand for immediate projects.

Urban Timber Supply serves both residential and commercial clients. Homeowners commission dining tables, benches, and statement pieces like a black walnut pool table built into a beachfront home. Commercial projects include office builds and conference tables, notably a custom table installed in the historic Murfreesboro Courthouse.

The company emphasizes preserving the story embedded in the wood. Its approach centers on well-sourced material, careful craftsmanship, and designs meant to feel personal, substantial, and lasting — turning a client''s own tree into a functional heirloom.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wood furniture manufacturing", "Live edge slab milling and finishing", "Resin infusion and casting", "Custom conference table fabrication", "Custom dining table fabrication", "Small handcrafted item production", "Slab inventory sales", "Custom design and build for residential and commercial"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Walnut", "Maple", "Ash", "Poplar", "Cherry", "Oak", "Epoxy Resin"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Furniture built from locally salvaged timber, often from clients'' own trees", "Produces pieces from small handcrafted items to 15-foot conference tables", "Integrates resin accents to support design while preserving slab character", "Completed a custom conference table for the historic Murfreesboro Courthouse", "Maintains inventory of hand-selected live-edge slabs (walnut, maple) ready for projects"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2015 -> db", "Headquarters Murfreesboro, Tennessee -> db", "Custom furniture from locally salvaged hardwood -> /", "Produces items from executive pens to 15-foot conference tables -> /about", "Materials: walnut, maple, ash, poplar, cherry, oak, resin -> /about", "Commercial project: Murfreesboro Courthouse conference table -> /about", "Residential and commercial clients -> /", "Inventory of black walnut and maple live-edge slabs -> /", "Resin used to support design and preserve slab character -> /about", "Goal to preserve meaning and history in wood -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Urban Timber Supply builds custom hardwood furniture from locally sourced and locally salvaged tre