UPDATE companies SET description='VTi by M. Davis Power Distribution Equipment operates from Newark, Delaware, as a division of M. Davis & Sons, Inc. The company manufactures and supplies low-voltage industrial electrical power distribution equipment for industry partners.

The VTi division combines engineering, fabrication, and testing to produce a range of UL-listed, U.S.-made power distribution products. Its lineup includes Unitized Distribution Systems (UDS), Dual Voltage UDS (dv-UDS), Portable Power Distribution Centers (PPDC), and Fused Distribution Panels (FDP) in both AC and DC versions. The company operates a panel shop where units are assembled, tested, and shipped ready for installation, and also offers panel refurbishing services that bring outdated equipment up to current UL-certified standards.

Customers include engineering firms, industrial plants, facilities, and construction projects that need temporary or permanent power distribution. The equipment serves in-plant applications, critical process protection, and temporary power for construction sites. The dv-UDS is designed for dual-voltage requirements, while the PPDC addresses fast-turnaround portable power needs.

The company positions itself as a turnkey "One Source for All" industrial construction services provider, delivering end-to-end custom solutions from layout through field installation and startup. It highlights a 20% cost savings factor for UDS units compared to separately mounted enclosures, and emphasizes full customization, UL listing, and domestic manufacturing as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['UL Listed','Rockwell Automation PartnerNetwork Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Powder coating to customer color specifications", "Process control systems", "Modular skid fabrication", "Electrical panel fabrication and assembly", "Panel refurbishing (sheet metal and electrical work)", "UL labeling and testing", "Engineering, fabrication, and testing of power distribution equipment"], "industries": ["Industrial manufacturing", "Construction", "Engineering firms", "Facilities management", "Critical process protection"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["UL-listed products made in the United States", "Fully customizable power distribution equipment", "Turnkey industrial construction services from layout to startup", "20% cost savings on Unitized Distribution Systems versus traditional enclosures", "Panel refurbishing to UL-certified standards"], "facts_used": ["Company name and division: VTi by M. Davis Power Distribution Equipment (owned by M. Davis & Sons, Inc.) -> db", "Headquarters: Newark, Delaware -> db", "Description: manufactures and supplies low voltage industrial electrical power distribution equipment -> db", "Certifications: UL Listed -> db", "Capabilities: powder coating, process control systems, modular skid fabrication -> db", "Products: UDS, dv-UDS, PPDC, FDP (AC/DC) -> /", "Services: engineering, fabrication, testing, panel shop assembly, refurbishing -> /", "Industries: engineering firms, plants, facilities, construction projects, critical process protection -> /", "Differentiators: UL listed, made in USA, fully customizable, turnkey services, 20% cost savings for UDS -> /", "Rockwell Automation PartnerNetwork Certification -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "M. Davis & Sons manufactures and supplies low voltage industrial electrical power distribution equipment", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='vti-by-m-davis-power-distribution-equipment-owned-by-m-davis-sons-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
